2025-12-20T18:22:54.554Z [iterm2] [info] Message from client: {"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"run_command","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/Documents/Projects/Current/writer && git commit -m \"Add segments and resegment CLI commands\n\nTwo new commands for working with topic segments:\n\n1. oralhistory segments <veteran_id>\n   - List all detected topic segments for a veteran\n   - Shows topic label, summary, response range\n   - Stars indicate high-potential responses\n   - Use -s <seg_id> to drill into specific segment\n   - Use --full to see response text inline\n\n2. oralhistory resegment [veteran_id] [--all] [--reindex]  \n   - Regenerate segments for existing veterans\n   - Works on single veteran or --all\n   - Optional --reindex to rebuild search embeddings\n   - Essential for veterans ingested before segmentation existed\n\nExample workflow:\n  oralhistory segments jarussi_hugo        # See narrative structure\n  oralhistory segments jarussi_hugo -s seg_003  # Drill into Bastogne segment\n  oralhistory resegment --all --reindex    # Add segments to old data\"","timeout":15}},"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":20} { metadata: undefined }
